### 0 cli render gear.wtf --format text
$ wtf render gear.wtf --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 1
--- stdout
[gear] := table = 4 rows · 4 columns
| item   | weight | value | take? |
| ------ | ------ | ----- | ----- |
| tent   | 3      | 9     |        ☑ yes|
| stove  | 1      | 4     |        ☑ yes|
| camera | 2      | 7     |        ☑ yes|
| books  | 4      | 3     |        ☐ no|
[pack] := maximize(sum(gear, value * take)) = 20 · take 3 of 4
| constraint | expression                    |
| ---------- | ----------------------------- |
| weight     | sum(gear, weight * take) <= 6 | ████████ 6 ≤ 6 · ● binding
[menu] := table = 2 rows · 4 columns
| dish  | cost | protein | servings# |
| ----- | ---- | ------- | --------- |
| beans | $2   | 15      |            → 4|
| eggs  | $3   | 12      |            → 0|
[diet] := minimize(sum(menu, cost * servings)) = $8 · servings 4
| constraint | expression                          |
| ---------- | ----------------------------------- |
| protein    | sum(menu, protein * servings) >= 50 | 60 ≥ 50 · ○ slack 10
[wrong] := sum(gear, weight * take)
--- stderr
<root>/gear.wtf:21:31: error: 'take' is a decision column; a plan chooses it, so sum over it inside maximize or minimize
wtf: 1 error(s) while rendering

